# A project's Pages: the library from the project tree, then a call's page read in place on the
# Calls page.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
prefer themeId aura-noir
prefer starAsked true
replies pages.json
project storefront shop
patch pages-notes.diff
chat Wren
title "Cache the product pages"
say "Plan the product page cache and show me the numbers."
settle 10
front Wren
settle 2
key cmd-alt-8
settle 3
snap pages-library
front Wren
settle 2
click "Which store should the product page cache use?"
settle 2
snap pages-call
click "Product page cache"
settle 3
snap pages-call-open
